Package: rustycogs
Title: TIFF Virtualization and Decoding via Rust
Version: 0.2.0.9004
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2471-7511"))
Description: Extract byte-range chunk references from cloud-hosted TIFF and
    COG files without reading pixel data. Uses the Rust 'async-tiff' and
    'object_store' crates for async I/O across S3, GCS, Azure, HTTP, and local
    storage. Returns a data frame of tile offsets and metadata suitable for
    constructing Kerchunk or Zarr virtual stores.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/hypertidy/rustycogs
BugReports: https://github.com/hypertidy/rustycogs/issues
